model geometry or artwork it generates or incorporates.

The full terms are in LICENSES/CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0.txt.
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

Attribute these original contributions to Dethios, link to
https://github.com/Dethios/3D_Prints, retain relevant notices and identify
your modifications as required by the applicable license.

Third-party material and exceptions
----------------------------------

These grants apply only to rights held by Dethios. Third-party source meshes,
designs, artwork, software and other assets retain their applicable licenses
and notices. File-specific or project-specific attribution and license notices
identify those terms. Retain those notices when sharing the affected material.

In particular, consult sorcerer_ears_CAD_STL_v2/SOURCES_AND_ATTRIBUTION.txt
for the NX3 and Tim J source families and their derivatives, and each crab-ear
project's attribution or source notices for its mounting geometry and artwork.
Existing CC BY 4.0 and CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 source grants remain applicable to their
respective source material.

Supplied reference illustrations whose rights have not been established are
excluded from these grants. Standalone downloaded models, slicer projects and
bundled references with no recorded license receive no new permission from
this file. Obtain their source terms before redistributing them.

This file grants no additional trademark, patent or personality rights.
